# Build outputs regenerated fresh by Internal\Prepare-CopilotCoE.ps1 on every
# 02_Install-CopilotCoE.ps1 / 03_Update-CoEContent.ps1 run (see Prepare-CopilotCoE.ps1
# line ~900, called unconditionally from 02_Install-CopilotCoE.ps1 line ~194).
# Never commit these: they are rewritten with the LAST-RUN organization's name,
# description and site text every time the kit is used, and would otherwise leak
# real customer/tenant details into git history. A fresh clone regenerates clean
# versions automatically the first time a script is run.
CopilotCoE-Kit/CopilotCoESite.pnp
CopilotCoE-Kit/TeamTemplate-CoE.xml
CopilotCoE-Kit/SiteAssetManifest.json

# Per-run transcripts and before/after audit snapshots captured in RevisionAudit.
# These contain real tenant URLs, admin UPNs, and site content from whichever
# organization last ran the kit. Always local-only.
CopilotCoE-Kit/RevisionAudit/
**/CoE-Advisory-Decisions.json
**/CoE-Revision-Report.json
**/CoE-Removal-Manifest.json
**/CoE-Purge-Receipt.json
**/Customer-Walkthrough-State.json
**/Backups/

# Transient staging folder created mid-build by Prepare-CopilotCoE.ps1, removed on
# success but can be left behind if a run is interrupted.
CopilotCoE-Kit/.prepare-*/

# Local organization folders some admins create under the kit before moving them to
# C:\CoE-Orgs\<org> per START-HERE.txt. Organization folders hold tenant-specific
# settings and must never be committed.
CopilotCoE-Kit/Orgs/

# Oversized vendor source package (~175 MB) exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file push
# limit. Published instead as a GitHub Release asset -- see README.md for the
# download link and where to place it locally.
SourceOriginal/CopilotCoESite/CopilotCoESite.pnp

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
